## 📝 RECOMMENDED NAVBAR STRUCTURE

### Option A: Two-Level Products Menu (RECOMMENDED)

```
Products (dropdown)
├── Main Products
│   ├── Oncology → /products/oncology
│   ├── R&D → /products/r-d
│   └── Research → /products/research
└── AI Engines
    ├── Oracle → /products/oracle
    ├── Forge → /products/forge
    ├── Boltz → /products/boltz
    └── Command Center → /products/command-center
```

### Option B: Separate "Products" and "Engines" Menus

```
Products (dropdown)
├── Oncology → /products/oncology
├── R&D → /products/r-d
└── Research → /products/research

AI Engines (dropdown)
├── Oracle → /products/oracle
├── Forge → /products/forge
├── Boltz → /products/boltz
└── Command Center → /products/command-center
```

**Recommendation**: **Option A** - Groups related items together, maintains hierarchy.

